  "title": "The Deadliest Decade: The Battle for Aero Supremacy",
  "summary": "Thus commenced the Battle for Aero Supremacy. Not another race passed where a new wrinkle wasn’t introduced. It wasn’t immediately clear whether this was a testament to the technical ingenuity of Formula 1 or to one-upmanship run amok. Wings moved farther forward and farther back. They grew wider and taller, then wider and taller still. […]",
